# Bench working files — the rig harness and measurement logs for Jan's E4XT.
# Kept IN the repo so a scratch clean-up cannot lose them, but NOT published:
# they encode one specific bench (ports, JACK capture names, device id) and
# 22 KB of capture history. The scratch copies under ~/temp are symlinks to
# these, so the ~75 probe scripts that `from rig import Rig` keep working.
# NOTE: gitignored means NOT versioned and NOT backed up by push.
bench/
